":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10725811126539,"title":"Oglinda LED Dreptunghiulara ARTEA Touch, 14W, 60X80cm, Sistem Dezaburire, Dimabila, Lumina Rece 6000K","handle":"oglinda-led-dreptunghiulara-60x80cm-e14s-50x80-touch-sistem-dezaburire","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-led-touch-oglinda.jpg?v=1746027766\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-dezaburire-oglinda_jpg_f4354e32-5260-48d0-b717-be314e4fe56e.webp?v=1744028987\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-end=\"387\" data-start=\"108\"\u003eAdaugă un plus de eleganță și funcționalitate băii tale cu oglinda LED \u003cstrong data-end=\"194\" data-start=\"179\"\u003eARTEA Touch\u003c\/strong\u003e. Prevăzută cu iluminare LED de \u003cstrong data-end=\"233\" data-start=\"226\"\u003e14W\u003c\/strong\u003e, lumină rece \u003cstrong data-end=\"256\" data-start=\"247\"\u003e6000K\u003c\/strong\u003e, funcție \u003cstrong data-end=\"275\" data-start=\"266\"\u003eTouch\u003c\/strong\u003e și \u003cstrong data-end=\"326\" data-start=\"302\"\u003esistem de dezaburire\u003c\/strong\u003e, aceasta oferă confort și vizibilitate optimă în fiecare zi.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"501\" data-start=\"389\"\u003eDesignul modern, fără ramă, cu iluminare perimetrală uniformă, se integrează perfect în orice baie contemporană.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"522\" data-start=\"503\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"522\" data-start=\"503\"\u003eCaracteristici:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"523\"\u003e\n\u003cli dat