354e32-5260-48d0-b717-be314e4fe56e.webp?v=1744028987\" alt=\"\"\u003eControl tactil intuitiv pentru pornire\/oprire și reglare rapidă a luminii. Funcția de dezaburire integrată menține suprafața oglindei curate după dușuri fierbinți, fără abur.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-cutie-oglinda.jpg?v=1744029165\" alt=\"\"\u003eDesign elegant, finisaj de calitate și consum redus de energie. Perfectă pentru rutina de machiaj, ras sau îngrijire personală. O soluție practică și estetică pentru orice baie contemporană.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-01-18T11:57:56+02:00","created_at":"2025-03-06T18:37:16+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Oglinzi Korman E","tags":["active","oglinda led","Oglinzi draft count"],"variants":[{"id":52429874692363,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-OG1D-E30S\/65X45","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"339.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"339.99","position":1,"product_id":9779340837131,"created_at":"2025-09-30T17:46:41+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69696451510539,"created_at":"2026-07-04T18:16:21+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-04T18:16:24+03:00","product_id":9779340837131,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_ccc89f1a-40cc-481b-82a5-528a361a4e66.webp?v=1783178184","width":800,"height":800},{"id":64250968768779,"created_at":"2026-01-09T18:34:01+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-01-09T18:34:06+02:00","product_id":9779340837131,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_c2159a38-103a-48b9-b15b-d23a7ffdfdaa.png?v=1767976446","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":64250990100747,"created_at":"2026-01-09T18:37:50+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"202