în care funcționalitatea se îmbină cu un design discret și elegant. Cu dimensiuni compacte de 50x80cm, iluminare LED dimabilă și sistem de dezaburire integrat, această oglindă oferă confort și vizibilitate excelente, indiferent de momentul zilei.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"\" data-end=\"995\" data-start=\"536\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"560\" data-start=\"538\"\u003eDimensiuni 50x80cm\u003c\/strong\u003e – format eficient, potrivit pentru băi de orice dimensiune.\u003cbr data-end=\"623\" data-start=\"620\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"651\" data-start=\"625\"\u003eIluminare LED dimabilă\u003c\/strong\u003e – reglezi lumina exact cum ai nevoie, fie pentru machiaj, fie pentru relaxare.\u003cbr data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"730\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"735\"\u003eSistem de dezaburire integrat\u003c\/strong\u003e – oglinda rămâne clară chiar și în cele mai umede condiții.\u003cbr data-end=\"831\" data-start=\"828\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"859\" data-start=\"833\"\u003eControl tactil (Touch)\u003c\/strong\u003e – activare ușoară, printr-o simplă atingere.\u003cbr data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"904\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"945\" data-start=\"909\"\u003eDesign modern, cu margini curate\u003c\/strong\u003e – se integrează perfect în decoruri contemporane.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"\" data-end=\"1128\" data-start=\"997\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T14:18:23+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-16T12:35:15+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00","vendor":"Korman Technik","product_type":"Oglinzi Korman E","tags":["active","All Stock"],"variants":[{"id":52429848740107,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-OG1D-E45S\/50X80","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"439.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"399.99","position":1,"product_id":10138019070219,"created_at":"2025-09-30T17:36:16+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":56697306382603,"created_at":"2025-06-23T13:54:45+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T15:54:43+03:00","product_id":10138019070219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Ovala_50x80cm_Llexort_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_1.png?v=1784033683","width":3000,"height":3000},{"id":56697215975691,"created_at":"2025-06-23T13:48:05+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T15:54:59+03:00","product_id":10138019070219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Ovala_50x80cm_Llexort_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_2.png?v=1784033699","width":3000,"height":3000},{"id":56696982601995,"created_at":"2025-06-23T13:30:31+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T15:55:10+03:00","product_id":10138019070219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Ovala_50x80cm_Llexort_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_3.png?v=1784033710","width":1500,"height":1500},{"id":56697215582475,"created_at":"2025-06-23T13:48:05+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T15:55:24+03:00","product_id":10138019070219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Ovala_50x80cm_Llexort_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_4.png?v=1784033724","width":3000,"height":3000},{"id":56697013633291,"created_at":"2025-06-23T13:32:25+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T15:55:37+03:00","product_id":10138019070219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Ovala_50x80cm_Llexort_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_5.png?v=1784033737","width":3000,"height":3000},{"id":69714088263947,"created_at":"2026-07-08T10:26:20+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T15:55:50+03:00","product_id":10138019070219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Ovala_50x80cm_Llexort_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_7.png?v=1784033750","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69714053333259,"created_at":"2026-07-08T10:23:12+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T15:55:58+03:00","product_id":10138019070219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Ovala_50x80cm_Llexort_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_8.png?v=1784033758","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10866633998603,"title":"Oglinda LED Touch Ivory Sistem Dezaburire 50X50cm","handle":"oglinda-led-touch-ivory-sistem-dezaburire-50x50cm","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eOglinda LED Touch Ivory de \u003cstrong\u003e50x50 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e este soluția ideală pentru o baie modernă, oferind iluminare eficientă și funcții inteligente pentru confortul zilnic. Designul minimalist se integrează ușor în orice stil de amenajare, iar iluminarea LED oferă o lumină uniformă, perfectă pentru machiaj, bărbierit sau îngrijirea personală.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOglinda este dotată cu \u003cstrong\u003esenzor touch\u003c\/strong\u003e, care permite pornirea și oprirea iluminării printr-o simplă atingere. În plus, \u003cstrong\u003esistemul de dezaburire integrat\u003c\/strong\u003e previne formarea condensului după duș sau baie, astfel încât oglinda rămâne mereu clară și gata de utilizare.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFabricată din materiale de calitate, oglinda este rezistentă la umiditate și potrivită pentru utilizarea zilnică în baie.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici principale:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDimensiune: \u003cstrong\u003e50 x 50 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare LED\u003c\/strong\u003e economică și uniformă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSenzor Touch\u003c\/strong\u003e pentru control rapid\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSistem dezaburire (anti-abur)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign modern, elegant – model \u003cstrong\u003eIvory\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeală pentru baie sau spații de toaletă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMontaj pe perete\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVizibilitate perfectă chiar și după duș\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConsum redus de energie datorită tehnologiei LED\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUtilizare simplă și intuitivă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAspect modern care completează decorul băii.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-led-touch-oglinda.jpg?v=1746027766\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-dezaburire-oglinda_jpg_f4354e32-5260-48d0-b717-be314e4fe56e.webp?v=1744028987\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-01-28T16:43:44+02:00","created_at":"2026-01-28T16:38:49+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Oglinzi Korman E","tags":["active","Oglinzi draft count"],"variants":[{"id":52850830082315,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-OG1D-E71S\/50X50","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"199.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"199.99","position":1,"product