9779344179467,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a7_5630b573-54c1-44df-a76b-7245d3b22e66.png?v=1756718869","width":2000,"height":2000}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10080683262219,"title":"Oglinda LED Rotunda 60cm, Spectrum Touch, RGB, Sistem Dezaburire","handle":"oglinda-led-rotunda-60cm-spectrum-touch-rgb-sistem-dezaburire","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-dezaburire-oglinda_jpg_f4354e32-5260-48d0-b717-be314e4fe56e.webp?v=1744028987\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-led-touch-oglinda.jpg?v=1744020308\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:88\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOglindă LED Rotundă Spectrum Touch RGB: Un Halo de Culoare Inteligent pentru Baia Ta\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:343\"\u003eTransformă-ți baia într-un spațiu captivant și modern cu oglinda LED Rotundă Spectrum Touch RGB. Cu forma sa circulară perfectă de 60 cm diametru, această oglindă inteligentă îmbină un design elegant cu o iluminare RGB vibrantă, control tactil intuitiv și sistem de dezaburire eficient, aducând un plus de stil și confort rutinei tale zilnice.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:28\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Circular Elegant:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:130\"\u003eForma rotundă a oglinzii Spectrum adaugă o notă de armonie și fluiditate în orice baie, creând un punct focal atrăgător și modern.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:34\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare RGB Personalizabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:204\"\u003eExplorează o paletă bogată de culori cu iluminarea RGB integrată. Alege nuanța care se potrivește stării tale de spirit sau decorului băii, creând o atmosferă unică și personalizată pentru fiecare moment.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-03-17T16:04:59+02:00","created_at":"2025-03-17T14:22:48+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00","vendor":"Korman Technik","product_type":"Oglinzi Korman E","tags":["active","All Stock"],"variants":[{"id":52427638571275,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-OG1D-E60S\/60X60","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"399.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"439.99","position":1,"product_id":10080683262219,"created_at":"2025-09-30T09:46:42+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":52842412998923,"created_at":"2025-04-02T20:02:06+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-04-03T12:04:45+03:00","product_id":10080683262219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a4_39cb9ce1-d769-48cc-a4bb-3bd8a9ff4e2e.png?v=1743671085","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":52842322133259,"created_at":"2025-04-02T19:56:06+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-04-03T12:04:45+03:00","product_id":10080683262219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_1a70cbe3-5e56-4b59-ae16-a83d96d4fc06.png?v=1743671085","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":52842352247051,"created_at":"2025-04-02T19:57:51+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-04-03T12:04:45+03:00","product_id":10080683262219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a3_c99d97f6-28db-41e7-b2a9-0be1b1133920.png?v=1743671085","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":52842322034955,"created_at":"2025-04-02T19:56:06+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-04-02T20:02:16+03:00","product_id":10080683262219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_18046c63-72f7-4f57-b5a5-93e2143dfa4d.png?v=1743613336","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":64309277688075,"created_at":"2026-01-12T12:55:45+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-01-12T12:55:48+02:00","product_id":10080683262219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/E60S_60X60_EPREL.png?v=1768215348","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10080709902603,"title":"Oglinda LED Arcata 60x80cm, Arco Touch, Sistem Dezaburire, Dimabila","handle":"oglinda-led-arcata-60x80cm-arco-touch-sistem-dezaburire-dimabila","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:225\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-dezaburire-oglinda_jpg_f4354e32-5260-48d0-b717-be314e4fe56e.webp?v=1744028987\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-led-touch-oglinda.jpg?v=1744020308\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:225\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:225\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOglinda LED Arcata Arco Touch este o oglinda de baie cu design oval, avand dimensiunile de 60x80cm. Este echipata cu iluminare LED, sistem de dezaburire si functie dimabila, controlate prin intermediul unei interfete tactile.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:225\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici și Funcționalități:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"11:1-17:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:88\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare LED:\u003c\/strong\u003e Produce o lumina uniforma pentru activitati de ingrijire personala.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:68\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSistem Dezaburire:\u003c\/strong\u003e Elimina condensul de pe suprafata oglinzii.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:62\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFunctie Dimabila:\u003c\/strong\u003e Permite reglarea intensitatii luminii.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:69\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eControl Touch:\u003c\/strong\u003e Operare prin intermediul unei interfete tactile.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:225\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-07T11:33:31+03:00","created_at":"2025-03-17T14:30:05+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00","vendor":"Korman Technik","product_type":"Oglinzi Korman E","tags":["active","All Stock"],"variants":[{"id":52378266435851,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-OG1D-E54S\/60X80","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"349.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"399.99","position":1,"product_id":10080709902603,"created_at":"2025-09-17T12:36:35+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":55284815069451,"created_at":"2025-05-09T17:53:12+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-05-09T17:53:17+03:00","product_id":10080709902603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_a42793b0-005b-43bc-9cdf-67ec4178d1bf.png?v=1746802397","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":55284905902347,"created_at":"2025-05-09T18:01:02+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-05-09T18:05:24+03:00","product_id":10080709902603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a4_20889ee8-f406-4239-b32e-3ce4fbb7daf6.png?v=1746803124","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":55284815102219,"created_at":"2025-05-09T17:53:13+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-05-09T18:05:24+03:00","product_id":10080709902603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a3_a730c9eb-51f4-4db6-a17a-aa55a348eb2d.png?v=1746803124","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":55284953841931,"created_at":"2025-05-09T18:05:02+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-05-09T18:05:24+03:00","product_id":10080709902603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a5_70ebd1ca-b22f-40b9-a2d9-c09107ed1aa3.png?v=1746803124","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":55284814905611,"created_at":"2025-05-09T17:53:13+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-05-09T18:05:24+03:00","product_id":10080709902603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_e3e674b6-b6c8-4045-baee-1b78eebf0ca7.png?v=1746803124","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":64309509521675,"created_at":"2026-01-12T13:33:01+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-01-12T13:33:05+02:00","product_id":10080709902603,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/E54S_60X80_EPREL.png?v=1768217585","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10138348355851,"title":"Oglinda LED Rotunda, 70cm, Orhina Touch, Sistem Dezaburire, Dimabila","handle":"oglinda-led-rectangulara-70cm-orhina-touch-sistem-dezaburire-dimabila","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-dezaburire-oglinda_jpg_f4354e32-5260-48d0-b717-be314e4fe56e.webp?v=1744028987\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-led-touch-oglinda.jpg?v=1744020308\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"526\" class=\"\"\u003eOglinda LED Orhina aduce echilibru între design minimalist și funcționalitate practică. Cu o lățime de 70cm și un format rectangular bine proporționat, este ideală pentru băi moderne sau spații de toaletă elegante. Iluminarea LED oferă o lumină plăcută și uniformă, activată printr-un control tactil discret.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"638\" class=\"\"\u003eSistemul de dezaburire integrat asigură vizibilitate impecabilă în orice moment, fără condens sau întreruperi.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"750\" class=\"\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"650\"\u003eOrhina\u003c\/strong\u003e este oglinda esențială pentru cei care preferă un design curat, cu funcții smart perfect integrate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T15:18:02+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-16T15:28:45+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00","vendor":"Korman Technik","product_type":"Oglinzi Korman E","tags":["active","All Stock","BF2025"],"variants":[{"id":52403315015947,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-OG1D-E40S\/70X70","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"279.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"439.99","position":1,"product_id":10138348355851,"created_at":"2025-09-22T23:46:09+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69659524235531,"created_at":"2026-07-03T16:25:05+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T16:25:08+03:00","product_id":10138348355851,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_cdc80276-c613-4eb5-b091-71d9d91c2c3a.webp?v=1783085108","width":800,"height":800},{"id":56741422891275,"created_at":"2025-06-24T18:35:32+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-09-17T11:42:02+03:00","product_id":10138348355851,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a3_473273b0-9f74-40b0-8f2e-fcf4e1e5fba7.png?v=1758098522","width":3000,"height":3000},{"id":56469758378251,"created_at":"2025-06-16T16:41:03+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-09-17T11:42:02+03:00","product_id":10138348355851,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_d9dd4289-708e-4382-886d-31ce74a9e0c1.png?v=1758098522","width":1900,"height":1900},{"id":56471260692747,"created_at":"2025-06-16T18:02:55+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-06-24T18:42:21+03:00","product_id":10138348355851,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a3_233a1b9e-b2b6-48b8-8935-bf26c214524e.png?v=1750779741","width":1500,"height":1500},{"id":56468686962955,"created_at":"2025-06-16T15:40:15+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-06-24T18:42:20+03:00","product_id":10138348355851,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_f3016fda-a483-4953-a0a9-ef989dff87c5.png?v=1750779740","width":1900,"height":1900},{"id":64309323071755,"created_at":"2026-01-12T13:04:00+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-01-12T13:04:03+02:00","product_id":10138348355851,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/E40S_70X70_EPREL.png?v=1768215843","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10138369655051,"title":"Oglinda LED Rotunda, 70cm, Lira Touch, Sistem Dezaburire, Dimabila","handle":"oglinda-led-rotunda-60cm-lira-touch-sistem-dezaburire-dimabila","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-dezaburire-oglinda_jpg_f4354e32-5260-48d0-b717-be314e4fe56e.webp?v=1744028987\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-led-touch-oglinda.jpg?v=1744020308\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"178\" class=\"\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"178\"\u003eOglindă LED Rotundă Lira Touch 70cm – rafinament și funcționalitate\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"502\" class=\"\"\u003eOglinda LED Lira Touch, cu design rotund și dimensiune de 60cm, adaugă un aer modern și elegant oricărui spațiu. Tehnologia de iluminare LED dimabilă îți permite să reglezi intensitatea luminii pentru confortul dorit, iar sistemul de dezaburire integrat păstrează oglinda perfect clară chiar și în condiții de umiditate.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"951\" class=\"\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"525\"\u003eDimensiune 60cm\u003c\/strong\u003e – un echilibru ideal între dimensiune și vizibilitate.\u003cbr data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"583\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"609\"\u003eSistem de dezaburire\u003c\/strong\u003e – elimină condensul, menținând oglinda impecabilă după fiecare utilizare.\u003cbr data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"686\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"714\"\u003eIluminare LED dimabilă\u003c\/strong\u003e – ajustezi lumina pentru a se potrivi cu fiecare moment al zilei.\u003cbr data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"783\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"802\"\u003eControl Touch\u003c\/strong\u003e – simplu și modern, cu funcționare prin atingere ușoară.\u003cbr data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"862\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"889\"\u003eDesign rotund elegant\u003c\/strong\u003e – adaugă un accent sofisticat în baie, dormitor sau dressing.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T14:13:24+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-16T15:54:02+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00","vendor":"Korman Technik","product_type":"Oglinzi Korman E","tags":["active","All Stock","BF2025","IULIE25"],"variants":[{"id":52156315894027,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-OG1D-E49S\/70X70","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"399.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"379.99","position":1,"product_id":10138369655051,"created_at":"2025-09-02T16:46:21+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69659507065099,"created_at":"2026-07-03T16:18:31+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T16:18:35+03:00","product_id":10138369655051,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a4_6c89a974-6345-4aab-914b-40b62aea00a2.webp?v=1783084715","width":800,"height":800},{"id":55360212533515,"created_at":"2025-05-12T18:19:43+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-05-12T18:20:09+03:00","product_id":10138369655051,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a3_1e2ad017-dc95-467d-b168-38ccdf3f7458.png?v=1747063209","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":55360212566283,"created_at":"2025-05-12T18:19:43+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-05-12T18:20:09+03:00","product_id":10138369655051,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_a35a3a15-c915-4ff6-a3c8-7d35f77fb33d.png?v=1747063209","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":55360212631819,"created_at":"2025-05-12T18:19:43+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-05-12T18:20:09+03:00","product_id":10138369655051,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a6_e06b7cb1-d1cf-4009-8562-47fcf2023ba9.png?v=1747063209","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":55360212664587,"created_at":"2025-05-12T18:19:43+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-05-12T18:20:09+03:00","product_id":10138369655051,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a5_908d9750-553f-43c2-8110-350de213181c.png?v=1747063209","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":55360212697355,"created_at":"2025-05-12T18:19:43+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-05-12T18:20:09+03:00","product_id":10138369655051,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_2fe94528-a4e3-4c04-b4d3-c8af791d058a.png?v=1747063209","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":64309264187659,"created_at":"2026-01-12T12:53:05+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-01-12T12:53:09+02:00","product_id":10138369655051,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/E49S_60X60_EPREL.png?v=1768215189","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10187192992011,"title":"Oglinda LED Rotunda 70cm,  Stellaire Touch, Sistem Dezaburire, Dimabila","handle":"oglinda-led-rotunda-70cm-stellaire-touch-sistem-dezaburire-dimabila","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-dezaburire-oglinda_jpg_f4354e32-5260-48d0-b717-be314e4fe56e.webp?v=1744028987\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-led-touch-oglinda.jpg?v=1744020308\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:256\"\u003eAdaugă o notă de eleganță modernă și tehnologie avansată băii tale cu oglinda LED Rotundă Stellaire Touch. Forma sa circulară perfectă, cu un diametru de 70 cm, creează un punct focal armonios, în timp ce funcțiile inteligente îți oferă confort și control.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:31\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Elegant și Armonios:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:206\"\u003eForma rotundă a oglinzii Stellaire aduce o senzație de echilibru și fluiditate în spațiul tău de baie. Dimensiunea de 70 cm este ideală pentru a oferi o vizibilitate excelentă fără a ocupa prea mult spațiu.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:46\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTehnologie Intuitivă pentru Confort Maxim:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"13:1-16:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:169\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSistem Anti-Aburire Eficient:\u003c\/strong\u003e Bucură-te de o imagine clară și neobstrucționată chiar și după cele mai fierbinți dușuri, datorită sistemului de dezaburire integrat.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:189\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eControl Tactil Sensibil (Touch):\u003c\/strong\u003e Gestionează cu ușurință iluminarea LED și funcția de dimare printr-o simplă atingere a senzorului tactil, oferind o interacțiune modernă și intuitivă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"15:1-16:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntensitate Luminoasă Personalizabilă (Dimabilă):\u003c\/strong\u003e Creează atmosfera perfectă pentru fiecare moment, ajustând nivelul de lumină emis de LED-uri în funcție de preferințele tale și de necesități.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2025-05-19T17:16:28+03:00","created_at":"2025-05-19T17:12:05+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00","vendor":"Korman Technik","product_type":"Oglinzi Korman E","tags":["active","All Stock"],"variants":[{"id":52386939568395,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-OG1D-E47S\/70X70","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"439.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"439.99","position":1,"product_id":10187192992011,"created_at":"2025-09-19T12:43:34+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":52849006444811,"created_at":"2025-04-03T01:04:54+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T16:17:08+03:00","product_id":10187192992011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Rotunda_60cm_Stellaire_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_3.png?v=1784035028","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":52849006641419,"created_at":"2025-04-03T01:04:54+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T16:16:53+03:00","product_id":10187192992011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Rotunda_60cm_Stellaire_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_2.png?v=1784035013","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":52849006838027,"created_at":"2025-04-03T01:04:54+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T16:16:41+03:00","product_id":10187192992011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\