c\/strong\u003e – oglinda rămâne clară chiar și în cele mai umede condiții.\u003cbr data-end=\"831\" data-start=\"828\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"859\" data-start=\"833\"\u003eControl tactil (Touch)\u003c\/strong\u003e – activare ușoară, printr-o simplă atingere.\u003cbr data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"904\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"945\" data-start=\"909\"\u003eDesign modern, cu margini curate\u003c\/strong\u003e – se integrează perfect în decoruri contemporane.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"\" data-end=\"1128\" data-start=\"997\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-09-24T20:05:46+03:00","created_at":"2025-09-03T15:00:05+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00","vendor":"Korman Technik","product_type":"Oglinzi Korman E","tags":["active","All Stock"],"variants":[{"id":52409720045835,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-OG1D-E45S\/60X80","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"379.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"399.99","position":1,"product_id":10693705662731,"created_at":"2025-09-24T21:23:36+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:11:40+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":56696982601995,"created_at":"2025-06-23T13:30:31+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T15:55:10+03:00","product_id":10693705662731,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Ovala_50x80cm_Llexort_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_3.png?v=1784033710","width":1500,"height":1500},{"id":56697215975691,"created_at":"2025-06-23T13:48:05+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T15:54:59+03:00","product_id":10693705662731,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Oglinda_LED_Ovala_50x80cm_Llexort_Touch_Sistem_Dezaburire_Dimabila_2.png?v=1784033699","width":3000,"height":3000},{"id":56697306382603,"created_at":"2025-06-23T13:54:45+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-14T